settle 90
ui-zoom 1
assert snap practice-saved == true
assert snap practice-save-problem == false
assert snap set-cards == 3
assert snap rehearsal-running == false
assert snap p5clock-status == stopped
assert snap p6-loop-mode == card
act p6-verify-reopen
capture 01_exact_guided_set_reopened
resize 420 1100
settle 6
capture 02_compact_guided_set_reopened
log P6 exact sealed fresh-process reopen complete
